title: Streetfighting
new-page: true
is-card: true
on-arrival: streetfighting_timer = 6; month_actions += 1; rb_militarization_cost = 2 if rb_militancy > 0.1 else rb_militarization_cost = 1; rb_militarization_cost = 3 if rb_militancy > 0.25; strife += 1
view-if: streetfighting_timer == 0 and not return_to_normalcy and streetviolence = 1
card-image: img/steeetfighting.jpg
tags: party_affairs; antifascism

= Streetfighting

Battles rage on the streets between the Solidarist SRNM, nationalist ROVS, communist Red Guard, and our own Soyuz Fevralya. In some parts of the country, conditions are nearing levels similar to the Civil War, as dozens of people are killed each month.

We must do something to protect the workers against these predations.

# - @battle: Test our defense units in battle against the Solidarists!
- @arm_rb: Increase training and armaments for the Esfe.
- @if_training: Train union members to fight as part of the Red Banner.
- @prussian_police_training: Use the National Militia to help train the Soyuz.
- @peace: Try to avoid all militant confrontations, as much as possible.
- @truce_rfb: Try to make peace with the Red Guard.
- @easy_discard

@battle
view-if: rb_militancy > 0.1 and rb_militancy < 0.5
on-arrival: rb_militancy += 0.1; sa_strength += 40; rb_strength -= 100; 
max-visits: 1

Many Esfe members are not ready for actual fighting, and thus quit. However, the remainder are toughened as a result. Our confrontations also provide ample recruiting material for the Nazi SA.

@arm_rb
subtitle: -[+ rb_militarization_cost +] resource
choose-if: resources >= rb_militarization_cost
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources ([+ rb_militarization_cost +] needed).
on-arrival: resources -= rb_militarization_cost; rb_militancy += 0.06; rb_strength += 50; sa_strength += 50; z_relation -= 5 if historical_mode 

We have increased training and purchased more armaments for the Esfe.

[? if historical_mode : The Center Party decries the militarization of the Reichsbanner, and its members are leaving the republican organization. ?]


@if_training
view-if: iron_front_formed == 1
on-arrival: rb_militancy += 0.03; rb_strength += 200; sa_strength += 50; 
max-visits: 2

As part of the Red Banner, we are increasing coordination between the Esfe and the unions, and many union members want to become more involved.

@prussian_police_training
view-if: rsdrp_prussia == 1 and prussian_police_loyalty > 0.5
on-arrival: rb_militancy += 0.05; sa_strength += 50; prussian_police_training += 1

The loyal sections of the National Militia can help train the Esfe.

@peace
on-arrival: rb_militancy -= 0.02; rb_strength -= 50; pacifism += 1

By not fighting, the strength of the Esfe atrophies, but Pacifists in the party are happier.

@truce_rfb
choose-if: rkp_relation >= 45
view-if: rkp_truce == 0
unavailable-subtitle: The RKP is not interested.
on-arrival: rkp_truce = 1; rkp_relation += 5; rfb_strength += 50; rb_strength += 50; sa_strength += 50;

We have made at least a temporary truce with the Red Guard, so that our respective paramilitaries will stop fighting.
